			<item>
				<title>5 April 26</title>
				<link>https://griz.sh/meetups/5-april-26/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 04 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://griz.sh/meetups/5-april-26/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;I was thinking of doing 8:30 at memorial park. This way we can try to avoid all the issue we ran into last time with all the people. Also I&amp;rsquo;ve never been there. Looks like a lot of grass. Start with some tracking exercises then obedience. Griz is still teething but is about ready to get on real bite work. Next weekend I want to go check out the high plains guys and their IGP training.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>29 March 26</title>
				<link>https://griz.sh/meetups/29-march-26/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://griz.sh/meetups/29-march-26/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;title is-1&#34;&gt;&#xA;  10:00 am Palmers Park.&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;title is-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Plan&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I purchased &lt;a href=&#34;https://university.leerburg.com/Catalog/viewCourse/cid/216&#34;&gt;Traiing Level 1Tracking Dogs for Police and Search and Rescue&lt;/a&gt;. I want to try working out some tracks the way he&amp;rsquo;s shows in this video.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;title is-3&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Setting a Track&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Go over hot spots&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Corners&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Downwind vs Upwind&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How often do we want to reward in footsteps?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;title is-3&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Scenario&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Handler lays track by walking out in a long straight line creating hot spots and rewarding some amount of the time. Lays down out of sight, waits with reward.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Helper waits 5 minutes then guides the handler&amp;rsquo;s dog down the track.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;title is-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Other stuff&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Griz is killing it with send aways and I have been expanding on the skill over the week. I can&amp;rsquo;t show you guys this week because her leg is hurt. However, I think I can help guide steps to improving send aways.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
